# The Zenodo concept DOI gets added after the first release.
abstract: >-
  A Python command-line tool that automatically generates participant
  report Word documents from Pavlovia CSV data exports. Supports
  configurable text and base64-image columns, per-participant documents,
  and a combined summary table.
